## Sidebar navigation (role + preset lens)

Built by [clinic-nav.ts](../../src/domain/nav/clinic-nav.ts) → [ClinicOpsShell.tsx](../../src/components/ClinicOpsShell.tsx).

| Group | Visibility | Routes |
|-------|------------|--------|
| Flat top | all authenticated | `/` (Home — full-width; shared date toolbar; for owner/`canViewExecutive`, `ExecutiveDashboard` first block above ops summary), `/patients` |
| Front desk | `RECEPTION` (+ admin/owner) | `/appointments` (practitioner day matrix), `/reception/queue`, `/cashier`, `/reception/extra-tickets` (sanatorium dual-run extras) |
| Clinical | `DOCTOR` / `NURSE` (+ admin/owner) | `/doctor` (DOCTOR), `/nurse` (NURSE), `/lab-orders`, `/reports/diagnoses` (DOCTOR; admin via `seesAll`) |
| Sanatorium | preset `sanatorium_clinical` | `/sanatorium` (RECEPTION, DOCTOR), `/sanatorium/resources` (RECEPTION), `/sanatorium/nurse-roster` (DOCTOR + admin — monthly nurse/lab duty matrix) |
| Inpatient | preset `inpatient_day` | `/inpatient` (ward tiles + admission diagnoses modal), `/inpatient/census`, `/admin/wards` (admin-only) |
| Wellness | preset `wellness` | placeholder (no routes yet — section auto-hides) |
| Catalogs | admin/owner | `/admin/catalog` (service prices), `/admin/diagnostic-catalog` (modalities/services/analytes/**favorites** tab), `/admin/icd-favorites` (ICD-10 pin + catalog sync/retire; no title CRUD), `/admin/templates`, `/admin/lookups` (BODY_PART), `/admin/physio-sites` (S + programs + substances + unmatched nahiye queue) |
| Rules & data | admin/owner | `/admin/procedure-rules`, `/admin/lis-profiles`, `/admin/master-data` |
| Platform | admin/owner | `/admin/audit`, `/admin/settings`, `/admin/access` |

Internal: `GET/POST /api/internal/v1/organization/bind` (orch Sync bindings; ADR satellite-organization-bind); `POST /api/internal/v1/procedure-validate`; `GET/POST /api/internal/v1/runtime-config` (incl. `clinicCutover` upsert). Cutover `#21` calls hotel `GET /api/internal/v1/stays/by-external-ref` then MDM `linkPersonIdentity`.

**SaaS Wave 2 request tenant:** staff `/api/auth/login` (+ optional `organizationId`) and SSO put org on JWT; middleware `x-era-organization-id`; `getRouteSession` → `enterSatelliteTenant`; lifecycle/from-stay/settlement enter ALS from event/body org; ops stamps via `requestOrganizationId()`. Cron remains appliance/DEDICATED-oriented. Not SHIPPED pool / AC-CLI-TENANT still 🟡.

Removed screens: `/executive` (merged into Home for owners), `/admin/catalog-favorites` (now a tab on `/admin/diagnostic-catalog`). Both routes deleted — no redirect.

**List UX (CLI-37):** `EraListFilterBar` = instant filters (no Apply; Reset inline; text search `useDebouncedValue` 300ms). Tables: name/title column first; row actions = Lucide icons + `TABLE_ROW_ICON_BTN_CLASS`. Home `/` full-width with one shared date for executive + ops.

`seesAll` = `canViewClinicAdmin || isPlatformSuperAdmin`. Nav is presentational; middleware + route guards remain authoritative.

