## Preset `sanatorium_clinical`

| Route | API |
|-------|-----|
| `/sanatorium` | Open courses (`EraListWorkspace` + **hotel room** + **program/package** filters; pager does not echo `page` from API); row actions: chart / procedures / patient modal; walk-in modal (sex M/F, DatePicker, program select, lab catalog); ICD via `IcdPicker` (`CatalogField` **SEARCHABLE**); `GET /api/sanatorium/episodes` (`roomNumber`, `programCode`, `includeHotelRooms=1`, `includeProgramCodes=1`); `POST …/[id]?action=diagnosis`; complete-checkup. Deep link **`/sanatorium?episode=`** (CLI-50). Checkup/walk-in Select prefers PKG-STANDART / PREMIUM / DERMO / DETOKS. **Wave E / CLI-54:** one row per OPEN episode |
| `/nurse` | Agenda (prev→EOD) + kanban; check-in while window open (endsAt +gap if next free); no nurse No-show; `GET /api/procedures?mine=1` |
| `/sanatorium/nurse-roster` | CLI-38 monthly duty matrix (paper physio nurse rotation). `GET/PUT/POST /api/sanatorium/nurse-roster`; absences `POST/DELETE /api/sanatorium/staff-absences`. Approve → planner prefers posted nurse |
| `/sanatorium/resources` | Location **day matrix board** (`ResourceDayMatrix`) + optional **fullscreen** overlay; horizon (rest/+1h/+3h) + patient filter; `GET …/calendar` uses Tenant working hours; DnD / move / cancel |

