## Print / diagnostic catalog extensions

- GET|POST /api/admin/diagnostic-catalog/imaging-phrases, PATCH|DELETE .../[id]
- GET /api/imaging-phrases (ops phrase picker)
- Analyte section / valueType / AnalyteValueOption via analytes admin API
- ADR: docs/adr/clinic-print-forms.md
- Print checkup (`/print/checkup/[patientId]`) includes episode ICD diagnoses (`print-checkup.service`); default sections = Nafta intake 4 (`therapist` / `gynecologist` / `cardiologist` / `usm`)
- Patient card `GET /api/patients/[id]/card-summary` → `intakeChecklist` from `PKG-NAFTA-INTAKE` (Visit + LabOrder status). Live: `instantiateIntakePackage` on `openEpisodeFromStay` / walk-in (idempotent ECG/USG; no physio FIFO)
- Cutover report: `scripts/nafta-cutover/rebuild-intake.cjs` (cards `slices.diagnostics`); map `src/lib/import/nafta-intake-map.ts`

## ICD-10 catalog (CLI-39…42)

Global WHO ICD-10 (2019) table `IcdCode` — **no** `organizationId`. Search `GET /api/icd` (selectable CATEGORY/LEAF only; not `/api/icd10`). ADR: [clinic-icd10-catalog.md](../../../docs/adr/clinic-icd10-catalog.md). Optional sync from orchestrator `GET /platform/v1/catalog/icd10` (in-process generator, not data-hub).
